/// Stops a model compilation job. To stop a job, Amazon SageMaker AI sends
/// the algorithm the SIGTERM signal. This gracefully shuts the job down. If
/// the job hasn't stopped, it sends the SIGKILL signal. When it receives a
/// StopCompilationJob request, Amazon SageMaker AI changes the
